---
description: Never show booking capacities or remaining seats on the public site
alwaysApply: true
---

# Public booking copy

Do not show how many seats a slot has, or how many are left, on any public page.

- Booking form: show date and time labels only. Hide capacity, remaining, weekday quota lines, and helper copy such as `Public holidays stay closed.`
- Full slots can be disabled or greyed out without saying how many are left.
- Internal dashboard and booking emails may still show booked / capacity.
